---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Login">
  <h1>Login / Create Account</h1>
  <p>This page will connect to <strong>Firebase Authentication</strong> (email + password, and optionally Google) in a future step.</p>
  <p>For now this is a placeholder form so we can finish the layout and navigation.</p>

  <form style="max-width:400px;margin-top:20px">
    <label>Email</label><br />
    <input
      type="email"
      name="email"
      placeholder="you@example.com"
      style="width:100%;padding:8px;margin:6px 0;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:4px"
    /><br />

    <label>Password</label><br />
    <input
      type="password"
      name="password"
      placeholder="••••••••"
      style="width:100%;padding:8px;margin:6px 0;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:4px"
    /><br />

    <button class="btn" type="button">Continue</button>
  </form>

  <p style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:#3A5E38;">
    Later: wire this to Firebase SDK in a small client script.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
